WEBVTT

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.200
Six a.m., the baby screams, the dog cries in the kitchen

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.100
My tea goes cold on the counter, I don't touch it

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.700
My girl wants to run it all, the baby wants a piggyback

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.000
And nobody asks me if I slept

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.700
It doesn't stop

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:27.500
It never, ever stops

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.000
The ants come back through the same old hole

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.200
And I climb the stairs again

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.800
I don't stop

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.200
Go on, try and stop me

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.500
I'm not tired

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.700
I'm winning

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:46.700
I'm winning

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.800
Walking the dog at noon, the neighbors still in pajamas

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:57.400
Daddy's boy, his third new car this year

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.300
The corner house is empty, nobody ever stays

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:03.100
Window's open, they're yelling, I slow down on purpose

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:04.100
"Do you believe in God?"

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.400
Them again, on my front step

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.300
Your God never once watched my kids

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.400
I don't give a fuck about your God

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.100
I don't stop

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:13.500
Go on, try and stop me

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:14.900
I'm not tired

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:16.700
I'm winning

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:26.600
By day he waits in the empty doghouse

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:32.100
A little red lion with a smiling face

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:38.400
At night I bring him up and keep him by my side

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:43.300
One still wakes me, the other one I miss

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:44.900
I don't stop

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:48.000
Except tonight — October fourth

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:50.700
Twenty-one years — I won

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:53.500
The whole night is mine
